        "title": "Insight into lives of Nepalese people",
        "text": "Visiting Pashupatinath and its cremation part provides an insight into the most difficult time of our lives. You can see the whole process from the preparation of the bodies until their complete burning. It's a very spiritual place and it's better to be ready for what you'll see. Worth to hire a local guide to show you around and explain what is happening. The entrance fee is 1000Rs. \nFrom Pashupatinath you can walk up to Bodnath Stupa.",
