        "title": "Be prepared for what you are going to see.",
        "text": "I'm not sure how to rate this. I was unprepared what I was going to see even though I had read about it. It has left an imprint in my mind, the wrapped up bodies, grieving families, the ash in the air, the garbage, the heavy heavy feeling of death. This is how I felt as a foreigner and a non Hindu. I would never take children. I paid the entrance fee, but left after about 10 mins. I won't forget this place. My rating says average but I need a whole different category.",
