        "title": "Holy Shrine",
        "text": "This is a very popular Hindu shrine and worth visiting if you are in Kathmandu. In the morning there are lot of rush but if you visit very early in the morning or around noon the crowd is less. I visited the place at 12:30 and there was no crowd. Photography is not allowed inside the main temple. There is a cremation place on the bank of the river which is visible once you are inside the main temple premises.",
